  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Quality for Inclusive Prosperity Program (EQUIP) &#x2013; Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment will help ensure secondary school learners have the skills they will need to participate meaningfully in the labour force. EQUIP&apos;s program outcomes are based on learners having better learning pathways and/or income-earning opportunities. The indicative program outcomes are: 1. Senior secondary school learners in selected locations are better equipped with the skills they need to transition to employment, whether immediately or after further study; 2. Government agencies improve the implementation of policies and processes that support skills pathways for all senior secondary school learners.</narrative>
  </description>
